  "goodToKnow": "Der Hopfen is hops, the climbing plant that gives beer bitterness and aroma. The Hallertau in Bavaria is the largest continuous hop-growing region in the world. The Bavarian Reinheitsgebot of 1516 allowed only water, barley and hops (yeast was not yet understood). Bei ihm ist Hopfen und Malz verloren means he's a hopeless case. It has no plural."
